    "Name": "Valkyrie VLK-QDD",
    "Details": "A 30 ton reconnaissance and light fire support Mech, the Valkyrie has been in continuous production since 2787. A Davion Mech, the Valkyrie VLK-QDD is powered by a 180-rated Light Engine and equipped with 6 Jump Jets. An Artemis IV augmented LRM-10 is the Mechs main weapon, with an ER Medium Laser for close range combat. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Communications</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
